  "title": "Red Hat Security Advisory: webkit2gtk3 security update",
  "description": "A security update for webkit2gtk3 addresses multiple vulnerabilities in the Skia graphics library used by chromium-browser within WebKitGTK. These include information leaks, use-after-free, cross-origin data disclosure, uninitialized resource usage, integer overflow, out-of-bounds reads, memory corruption, and improper input validation. The update is rated as important by Red Hat and affects Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8 variants. The advisory references numerous CVEs detailing these issues.",
